#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp
msgid "Allow exceeding max height"
msgstr "Allow exceeding max height"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp
msgid ""
"By default, G-code export is blocked when any generated Z movement, "
"including Z offset, Z-hop or lift, and custom G-code, exceeds Max print "
"height. Enable this option to allow such G-code to be exported. This does "
"not allow models taller than Max print height and does not change the "
"printer's physical limits. Enable it only if the printer can safely execute "
"movements beyond the configured maximum height."
msgstr ""
"By default, G-code export is blocked when any generated Z movement, "
"including Z offset, Z-hop or lift, and custom G-code, exceeds Max print "
"height. Enable this option to allow such G-code to be exported. This does "
"not allow models taller than Max print height and does not change the "
"printer's physical limits. Enable it only if the printer can safely execute "
"movements beyond the configured maximum height."

