#: src/libslic3r/GCode/GCodeProcessor.cpp
msgid ""
"Reduce the model or layer height, Z offset, Z-hop/lift, or the responsible "
"custom G-code movement. To override this safety check, enable Allow "
"exceeding max height in Printer Settings > General > Size and coordinates. "
"The maximum permitted model height remains unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Reduce the model or layer height, Z offset, Z-hop/lift, or the responsible "
"custom G-code movement. To override this safety check, enable Allow "
"exceeding max height in Printer Settings > General > Size and coordinates. "
"The maximum permitted model height remains unchanged."

