#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4933
msgid "Injection every N layers"
msgstr "Injection every N layers"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4935
msgid ""
"Defines the vertical cadence of Apium injection and phase switching in "
"Alternate 180 mode. Apium keeps the same wave phase for N consecutive "
"layers, then flips phase and injects on the flip layer. This stacks "
"identical wave channels in Z to form deeper pockets before injection, "
"improving mechanical anchoring for high-warping materials. Injected target "
"volume is scaled linearly with N to account for deeper pockets. In Fixed "
"phase mode this setting is ignored."
msgstr ""
"Defines the vertical cadence of Apium injection and phase switching in "
"Alternate 180 mode. Apium keeps the same wave phase for N consecutive "
"layers, then flips phase and injects on the flip layer. This stacks "
"identical wave channels in Z to form deeper pockets before injection, "
"improving mechanical anchoring for high-warping materials. Injected target "
"volume is scaled linearly with N to account for deeper pockets. In Fixed "
"phase mode this setting is ignored."

