"Apium is a recursive acronym for \"Apium Perimeter Interweaving Undulating "
"Method\". It generates interweaving undulating perimeter channels between "
"outer and inner shell anchors. Wave phase alternates between layers to "
"interlock pockets and reduce warping stress while improving Z-direction "
"anchoring."
msgstr ""
"Apium is a recursive acronym for \"Apium Perimeter Interweaving Undulating "
"Method\". It generates interweaving undulating perimeter channels between "
"outer and inner shell anchors. Wave phase alternates between layers to "
"interlock pockets and reduce warping stress while improving Z-direction "
"anchoring."

