#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp
msgid ""
"Zoneheater operation mode.\n"
"Off: no zoneheater commands are emitted.\n"
"Static: a fixed power level (zoneheater_static_power) is set once at the "
"start; the variable tool is disabled.\n"
"Variable: per-layer power is controlled via the variable zoneheater power "
"profile; the static power setting is inactive.\n"
"Cranial (experimental): per-object, per-layer axis gradient mode with center/"
"edge power bands.\n"
"Adaptive: automatic adaptive heating (uses zoneheater_adaptive_multiplier)."
msgstr ""
"Zoneheater operation mode.\n"
"Off: no zoneheater commands are emitted.\n"
"Static: a fixed power level (zoneheater_static_power) is set once at the "
"start; the variable tool is disabled.\n"
"Variable: per-layer power is controlled via the variable zoneheater power "
"profile; the static power setting is inactive.\n"
"Cranial (experimental): per-object, per-layer axis gradient mode with center/"
"edge power bands.\n"
"Adaptive: automatic adaptive heating (uses zoneheater_adaptive_multiplier)."

