#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5663
msgid ""
"Nozzle temperature for this extrusion line type. Enter an absolute "
"temperature such as 210, a signed offset such as +10 or -20, or a signed "
"percentage such as +15% or -10%. Relative values use the preceding "
"temperature stage as their base. Values 0, +0, -0, +0% and -0% leave the "
"base unchanged. Percentage offsets are limited to +/-200%, and the result is "
"clamped to the material extrusion temperature limits. Automatic line-type "
"control is disabled when the normal material temperature is 0 or automatic "
"temperature commands are disabled. Frequent changes may be too fast for the "
"printer's thermal response."
msgstr ""
"Nozzle temperature for this extrusion line type. Enter an absolute "
"temperature such as 210, a signed offset such as +10 or -20, or a signed "
"percentage such as +15% or -10%. Relative values use the preceding "
"temperature stage as their base. Values 0, +0, -0, +0% and -0% leave the "
"base unchanged. Percentage offsets are limited to +/-200%, and the result is "
"clamped to the material extrusion temperature limits. Automatic line-type "
"control is disabled when the normal material temperature is 0 or automatic "
"temperature commands are disabled. Frequent changes may be too fast for the "
"printer's thermal response."

