"percentage such as +15% or -10%. An absolute 0 turns the fan off, while "
"signed zero leaves the preceding target unchanged. Relative values use the "
"preceding fan stage as their base, percentage offsets are limited to "
"+/-200%, and resolved line-type targets are clamped to 0-100%."
